@startuml ChartLibraryPRPipelineFlow
title Chart Library PR Validation Flow (Azure DevOps)

start

:PR opened or updated;
:Validate job\n(run local chart tests);

if (Build.Reason == PullRequest?) then (Yes)
	:Validate_Consumer_Compatibility job;
	:Package candidate library chart;

	repeat
		:Clone consumer chart;
		:Inject candidate library chart;
		:helm lint;
		:helm template | kubeconform;
		:helm unittest (if enabled);
	repeat while (more consumer charts?) is (Yes)
	->No;

	if (All consumer checks passed?) then (Yes)
		:PR checks pass;
	else (No)
		:PR checks fail;
	endif
else (No)
	:Consumer compatibility skipped\n(not a PR run);
endif

stop

note right
	Validation always runs against the
	PR's own un-bumped templates.
	Template version bumping is handled
	separately after merge to master
	(see chart-library-bump-template-workflow.puml).
end note

@enduml
